{"dur": 25.32, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "« Ça existe déjà », on me dit.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 3.245, "words": [{"w": "«", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "Ça", "t": 1.276}, {"w": "existe", "t": 1.503}, {"w": "déjà", "t": 2.033}, {"w": "»,", "t": 2.412}, {"w": "on", "t": 2.488}, {"w": "me", "t": 2.715}, {"w": "dit.", "t": 2.942}]}, {"id": "suspense", "text": "Oui. Mais pas ici.", "t0": 4.045, "t1": 5.355, "words": [{"w": "Oui.", "t": 4.045}, {"w": "Mais", "t": 4.353}, {"w": "pas", "t": 4.739}, {"w": "ici.", "t": 5.047}]}, {"id": "realite", "text": "Les outils qui existent sont chers, lourds, et pensés pour d'autres habitudes de dessin.", "t0": 6.255, "t1": 11.369, "words": [{"w": "Les", "t": 6.255}, {"w": "outils", "t": 6.493}, {"w": "qui", "t": 6.909}, {"w": "existent", "t": 7.147}, {"w": "sont", "t": 7.682}, {"w": "chers,", "t": 7.98}, {"w": "lourds,", "t": 8.336}, {"w": "et", "t": 8.753}, {"w": "pensés", "t": 8.931}, {"w": "pour", "t": 9.347}, {"w": "d'autres", "t": 9.644}, {"w": "habitudes", "t": 10.18}, {"w": "de", "t": 10.774}, {"w": "dessin.", "t": 10.953}]}, {"id": "notre", "text": "Nous, on écrit pour nos sections, nos aciers, nos conventions. Et nos délais.", "t0": 11.749, "t1": 15.95, "words": [{"w": "Nous,", "t": 11.749}, {"w": "on", "t": 12.036}, {"w": "écrit", "t": 12.209}, {"w": "pour", "t": 12.555}, {"w": "nos", "t": 12.842}, {"w": "sections,", "t": 13.073}, {"w": "nos", "t": 13.591}, {"w": "aciers,", "t": 13.821}, {"w": "nos", "t": 14.224}, {"w": "conventions.", "t": 14.454}, {"w": "Et", "t": 15.145}, {"w": "nos", "t": 15.317}, {"w": "délais.", "t": 15.548}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "CivRebar AI, c'est un outil de chez nous, pour nos chantiers.", "t0": 16.33, "t1": 20.005, "words": [{"w": "CivRebar", "t": 16.33}, {"w": "AI,", "t": 16.891}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 17.078}, {"w": "un", "t": 17.451}, {"w": "outil", "t": 17.638}, {"w": "de", "t": 18.012}, {"w": "chez", "t": 18.199}, {"w": "nous,", "t": 18.51}, {"w": "pour", "t": 18.822}, {"w": "nos",